00:32:44.580 --> 00:32:47.790
Like every experience that you were having

775
00:32:47.790 --> 00:32:51.630
or could potentially have was calibrated only

776
00:32:51.630 --> 00:32:53.520
in the context of how it would contribute

777
00:32:53.520 --> 00:32:55.230
to that day's video.
Exactly.

778
00:32:55.230 --> 00:32:58.140
And that meant friendship.
That's like crazy making

779
00:32:58.140 --> 00:32:59.130
to live your life that way.

780
00:32:59.130 --> 00:33:03.243
Completely. Friendships, relationships, lunches.

781
00:33:03.243 --> 00:33:05.100
Like no meetings, I'm not taking a meeting

782
00:33:05.100 --> 00:33:10.100
unless it was, I could make it into a scene in the movies,

783
00:33:10.170 --> 00:33:11.220
which was really hard to do.

784
00:33:11.220 --> 00:33:12.270
Meetings are not interesting.

785
00:33:12.270 --> 00:33:14.170
So most meetings, I would just say no.

786
00:33:15.030 --> 00:33:16.980
Or Jeffrey Katzenberg wanted to meet once

787
00:33:16.980 --> 00:33:18.990
and my agent called me, he was like,

788
00:33:18.990 --> 00:33:20.220
Katzenberg wants to meet with you.

789
00:33:20.220 --> 00:33:22.830
And I was like, whoa. I was like, that guy's a huge deal.

790
00:33:22.830 --> 00:33:24.510
I was like, you think I can film it?

791
00:33:24.510 --> 00:33:25.343
And he is like, no, you can't film it.

792
00:33:25.343 --> 00:33:27.870
And I was like, (tongue clicks)

793
00:33:27.870 --> 00:33:29.410
tell him I'm busy, I can't do it.

794
00:33:29.410 --> 00:33:30.420
And he's like, Casey, you don't.

795
00:33:30.420 --> 00:33:32.067
And I was like, okay, okay, okay, okay.

796
00:33:32.067 --> 00:33:34.090
And I remember it like fucked up my day.

797
00:33:34.090 --> 00:33:36.060
I was like an hour and 20 minutes at lunch,

798
00:33:36.060 --> 00:33:38.070
I'm like drumming my fingers 'cause I'm thinking to myself,

799
00:33:38.070 --> 00:33:41.040
this is really gonna step back today's production.

800
00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:43.890
But it was always, it was a pursuit of interestingness

801
00:33:43.890 --> 00:33:47.280
that was just unrelenting.

802
00:33:47.280 --> 00:33:50.670
And I don't think I could do that anywhere

803
00:33:50.670 --> 00:33:52.320
