804
00:33:52.320 --> 00:33:54.210
I think having a highly controlled environment

805
00:33:54.210 --> 00:33:56.160
made that very easy to do.

806
00:33:56.160 --> 00:33:57.780
Having a revolving cast of characters

807
00:33:57.780 --> 00:34:01.260
that I knew I could call on made that doable.

808
00:34:01.260 --> 00:34:02.940
And it was myriad other factors.

809
00:34:02.940 --> 00:34:05.940
But I think we started this off by, you were asking me,

810
00:34:05.940 --> 00:34:09.240
what is it like when I think about that now versus-

811
00:34:09.240 --> 00:34:11.100
Right, like your perspective on, you know,

812
00:34:11.100 --> 00:34:14.460
what it means to you and kind of how it set you up

813
00:34:14.460 --> 00:34:16.830
for the career that you wanna have

814
00:34:16.830 --> 00:34:18.030
or maybe don't wanna have.

815
00:34:18.030 --> 00:34:20.010
I think that the biggest difference

816
00:34:20.010 --> 00:34:22.140
was everything was fair game then.

817
00:34:22.140 --> 00:34:23.400
And when I say that, I mean like,

818
00:34:23.400 --> 00:34:26.280
the depths of my psyche were fair game.

819
00:34:26.280 --> 00:34:28.173
Like nothing was off limits.

820
00:34:29.070 --> 00:34:31.620
I say that, obviously, my family was off limits.

821
00:34:31.620 --> 00:34:34.200
Like when my children turned,

822
00:34:34.200 --> 00:34:35.520
when my oldest daughter turned one,

823
00:34:35.520 --> 00:34:37.080
I stopped putting my kids in altogether

824
00:34:37.080 --> 00:34:38.340
'cause she stopped looking like a baby

825
00:34:38.340 --> 00:34:40.020
and started to look a little bit distinguishable.

826
00:34:40.020 --> 00:34:42.420
So I cut my kids out, which made it challenging.

827
00:34:43.590 --> 00:34:45.480
But I mean like, as far as me,

828
00:34:45.480 --> 00:34:47.250
there was nothing I would omit.

829
00:34:47.250 --> 00:34:50.620
There was no version of myself that I wouldn't externalize

830
00:34:51.510 --> 00:34:53.640
and that fucks you up.

831
00:34:53.640 --> 00:34:57.030
Like, I did that as I was a 37, 38-year old,

832
00:34:57.030 --> 00:35:01.020
fairly well-adjusted, adult man.

833
00:35:01.020 --> 00:35:04.980
And I had completely exhausted who I am.

834
00:35:04.980 --> 00:35:07.350
It was like, the orange, that was my brain.

835
00:35:07.350 --> 00:35:10.547
I squeezed every ounce of juice out of it.

836
00:35:10.547 --> 00:35:12.660
And that was really destructive in the long.

837
00:35:12.660 --> 00:35:14.250
You start to really get fucked up.

838
00:35:14.250 --> 00:35:16.890
And I highlight that I was a well-adjusted man when I did it

839
00:35:16.890 --> 00:35:19.620
