The fact that no one knows that in New York City,

914
00:38:13.920 --> 00:38:15.720
behind these closed doors on the fourth floor,

915
00:38:15.720 --> 00:38:18.900
this fucked up office building on 38th Street,

916
00:38:18.900 --> 00:38:20.850
that there's this like 80-year old guy

917
00:38:20.850 --> 00:38:24.090
who manages 20 seamstress and all they do

918
00:38:24.090 --> 00:38:28.200
is make handcrafted leather goods in New York City.

919
