Yeah.

964
00:40:09.960 --> 00:40:12.300
And that's when I knew it was time to take a break.

965
00:40:12.300 --> 00:40:15.870
Right, well, it was intrinsically unsustainable affair

966
00:40:15.870 --> 00:40:16.860
to begin with.
Of course.

