like really amazing stuff that you watch

1038
00:43:14.850 --> 00:43:19.293
and it means something to you is as small as it's ever been.

1039
00:43:20.310 --> 00:43:22.770
Everything is ephemera.

1040
00:43:22.770 --> 00:43:23.970
Yeah.
And on TikTok,

1041
