1044
00:43:32.100 --> 00:43:34.230
Sure, so if in the course of a year,

1045
00:43:34.230 --> 00:43:36.240
I'm making numbers up, but if in the course of the year,

1046
00:43:36.240 --> 00:43:40.170
you see a hundred things, paintings or hear songs

1047
00:43:40.170 --> 00:43:45.000
or watch movies or YouTube videos or see a picture

1048
00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:47.070
or watch a TikTok that affect you,

1049
00:43:47.070 --> 00:43:48.820
that you don't stop thinking about,

1050
00:43:50.460 --> 00:43:52.980
we're now seeing a million.

1051
00:43:52.980 --> 00:43:55.050
But that number of how many affect you,

1052
00:43:55.050 --> 00:43:56.803
that hasn't move for me.

1053
00:43:56.803 --> 00:44:00.333
I don't see more brilliant stuff. I just see more stuff.

1054
00:44:01.170 --> 00:44:04.020
And what concerns me is that

1055
00:44:04.020 --> 00:44:06.150
that's what's sort of being celebrated is like,

1056
00:44:06.150 --> 00:44:08.040
now, it's purely about the metrics

1057
00:44:08.040 --> 00:44:11.040
and not about how you achieve those metrics, and that sucks.

1058
00:44:12.960 --> 00:44:14.160
I don't know where that goes.

1059
00:44:14.160 --> 00:44:16.020
I don't know where that goes from here.

1060
00:44:16.020 --> 00:44:17.700
And I don't know what that means.

1061
00:44:17.700 --> 00:44:22.020
Like I had a very, I think eloquent sort of monologue

1062
00:44:22.020 --> 00:44:26.340
