is gonna main, it finally is an art form

1064
00:44:28.980 --> 00:44:30.600
that everybody has access to.

1065
00:44:30.600 --> 00:44:32.310
And we're not gonna get to see new perspectives

1066
00:44:32.310 --> 00:44:35.130
and ideas shared in ways we'd never seen before.

1067
00:44:35.130 --> 00:44:37.230
Because you don't have to go to NYU film school

1068
00:44:37.230 --> 00:44:38.463
to make something.

1069
00:44:39.840 --> 00:44:41.910
And I think that probably is still true,

1070
00:44:41.910 --> 00:44:43.980
but we're watching it manifest

1071
00:44:43.980 --> 00:44:47.130
and I'm not seeing new brilliant shit that's like,

1072
00:44:47.130 --> 00:44:48.663
wow, I didn't see that coming.

1073
00:44:49.920 --> 00:44:51.243
And that kind of sucks.

1074
00:44:52.170 --> 00:44:53.940
It does make me wanna go back

1075
