1077
00:45:01.230 --> 00:45:05.220
to find success, that will be very reassuring.

1078
00:45:05.220 --> 00:45:10.220
But if I make stuff that I still feel like is good

1079
00:45:11.070 --> 00:45:13.533
and I'm really proud of and nobody watches it,

1080
00:45:14.520 --> 00:45:17.390
I don't know what that would be, I'd still be psyched.

1081
00:45:17.390 --> 00:45:19.290
Maybe you still have the satisfaction of-

1082
00:45:19.290 --> 00:45:20.370
I'll still be psyched,

1083
00:45:20.370 --> 00:45:22.500
as long as I think I'll still be psyched about it,

1084
00:45:22.500 --> 00:45:25.191
but it would be telling of where we are right now.

1085
00:45:25.191 --> 00:45:27.180
You know, is somebody more likely

1086
00:45:27.180 --> 00:45:29.370
to try to follow in your footsteps

1087
00:45:29.370 --> 00:45:31.770
