1088
00:45:31.770 --> 00:45:34.530
where it's just easier to audience capture

1089
00:45:34.530 --> 00:45:36.150
and create these short little things

1090
00:45:36.150 --> 00:45:37.860
and jump on trends.

1091
00:45:37.860 --> 00:45:39.150
To be really cynical. It's like-

1092
00:45:39.150 --> 00:45:41.010
Or are you gonna make, or are you gonna be the guy

1093
00:45:41.010 --> 00:45:43.530
or are you gonna be like the guys

1094
00:45:43.530 --> 00:45:46.440
that made everything everywhere all at once?

1095
00:45:46.440 --> 00:45:48.463
You know, there is like some incredible filmmaking going on.

1096
00:45:48.463 --> 00:45:50.580
Dude, have you seen Top Gun?

1097
00:45:50.580 --> 00:45:52.350
Yeah, it's unbelievable.
It's unbelievable.

1098
00:45:52.350 --> 00:45:54.530
I haven't stopped, like I'm trying to time it

1099
00:45:54.530 --> 00:45:55.860
so I can sneak into theaters

1100
00:45:55.860 --> 00:45:59.190
