1103
00:46:03.690 --> 00:46:06.420
But there's just not more good shit being made.

1104
00:46:06.420 --> 00:46:08.010
It's more on the margins

1105
00:46:08.010 --> 00:46:11.790
and everybody's attention is focused on, you think so?

1106
00:46:11.790 --> 00:46:13.470
I think so, yeah. I think so.

1107
00:46:13.470 --> 00:46:15.000
I mean, look, we've had those amazing years

1108
00:46:15.000 --> 00:46:16.740
where there's been 20 brilliant movies made,

1109
00:46:16.740 --> 00:46:18.420
but I think for the most part,

1110
00:46:18.420 --> 00:46:20.790
there's always been so much garbage and noise.

1111
00:46:20.790 --> 00:46:22.317
I think the difference now,

1112
00:46:22.317 --> 00:46:25.109
and I can use journalism as an example of this,

1113
00:46:25.109 --> 00:46:26.850
and I say this very gently,

1114
00:46:26.850 --> 00:46:30.690
as to not broach into the like fake news discussion,

1115
00:46:30.690 --> 00:46:34.470
but I think now we're able to see all news outlets

1116
00:46:34.470 --> 00:46:36.450
are able to quantify click throughs

1117
00:46:36.450 --> 00:46:37.620
and how much time people are spending

1118
00:46:37.620 --> 00:46:38.790
in every given article.

1119
00:46:38.790 --> 00:46:41.670
And like, if you're running a business,

1120
00:46:41.670 --> 00:46:43.620
if you own a newspaper,

1121
