you need those clicks to pay the bills.

1122
00:46:45.930 --> 00:46:48.450
Like it's fact, it's fact.

1123
00:46:48.450 --> 00:46:50.100
So there's going to be this attraction

1124
00:46:50.100 --> 00:46:53.340
to publishing more of what gets clicks

1125
00:46:53.340 --> 00:46:55.080
and that kind of sucks.
Yeah.

1126
00:46:55.080 --> 00:46:56.487
That kind of sucks.
It's not good

1127
00:46:56.487 --> 00:46:58.560
for a cohesive healthy society.

1128
00:46:58.560 --> 00:47:02.700
It's not and so like apply that to creativity as well.

1129
00:47:02.700 --> 00:47:07.380
It's like, it's not the super well-made, brilliant,

1130
00:47:07.380 --> 00:47:09.120
with the exception of Top Down, which is crushing it

1131
00:47:09.120 --> 00:47:13.320
in the box office, like it's not always.

1132
00:47:13.320 --> 00:47:15.210
You know, like, name a year

1133
00:47:15.210 --> 00:47:17.790
when the highest grossing box office hit

1134
00:47:17.790 --> 00:47:19.713
was also won best picture.

1135
00:47:20.887 --> 00:47:23.457
Never happens. Never happens.

1136
00:47:23.457 --> 00:47:25.018
And now we're sort of seeing that-

1137
00:47:25.018 --> 00:47:25.950
Maybe "Gone with the Wind."

1138
00:47:25.950 --> 00:47:27.753
Perhaps, that's really pushing it,

1139
00:47:28.770 --> 00:47:30.180
pushing it way back.
Yeah.

1140
00:47:30.180 --> 00:47:33.600
But now, we're able to see that in such a rapid fire,

1141
00:47:33.600 --> 00:47:35.490
with such vivid quantification,

1142
00:47:35.490 --> 00:47:37.830
with such vivid metrics behind it.

1143
00:47:37.830 --> 00:47:40.140
If you make some shitty prank video

1144
00:47:40.140 --> 00:47:43.290
that has boobs in the thumbnail

1145
00:47:43.290 --> 00:47:47.370
and some racy title and it gets clicks,

1146
00:47:47.370 --> 00:47:48.630
that's where the rewards are

1147
00:47:48.630 --> 00:47:51.450
and that's what's going to be pursued.

1148
00:47:51.450 --> 00:47:53.100
That's a little bit antiquated because I don't think people

1149
00:47:53.100 --> 00:47:54.330
are making content like that anymore,

1150
00:47:54.330 --> 00:47:56.490
I think it's more sophisticated now.

1151
00:47:56.490 --> 00:47:58.926
But I think, to be super reductive,

1152
00:47:58.926 --> 00:48:03.690
it's easier to follow trends, to find success,

1153
00:48:03.690 --> 00:48:07.080
as long as your metric of success is clicks and views

1154
00:48:07.080 --> 00:48:08.430
and plays and all of those things

1155
00:48:08.430 --> 00:48:12.570
which do have financial attachments to all of them

1156
00:48:12.570 --> 00:48:15.720
than it is to just trying to pursue what is creatively,

1157
00:48:15.720 --> 00:48:16.860
socially meaningful.

1158
00:48:16.860 --> 00:48:20.280
Right, and as somebody who's squarely

1159
00:48:20.280 --> 00:48:25.280
in the Gen X category, I grew up in a time when, you know,

1160
00:48:25.320 --> 00:48:29.613
if you were to kind of leverage commerce,

1161
00:48:32.310 --> 00:48:33.747
you were considered a sell out.

1162
00:48:33.747 --> 00:48:36.210
And like just you would get trampled, right?

1163
00:48:36.210 --> 00:48:38.640
And now, that's completely flipped on its head

1164
00:48:38.640 --> 00:48:41.580
where people are celebrated for that very thing

1165
00:48:41.580 --> 00:48:44.913
that my generation would malign.

1166
00:48:45.960 --> 00:48:49.260
Sure, and now, that's the pursuit rather than like,

1167
00:48:49.260 --> 00:48:50.250
that's the goal.

1168
00:48:50.250 --> 00:48:53.340
How can I get to that point where I can take advantage

1169
00:48:53.340 --> 00:48:54.990
of all these fucked up incentives?

1170
00:48:54.990 --> 00:48:57.300
Yeah, forget about the means,

1171
00:48:57.300 --> 00:48:58.560
the focus isn't on the means,

1172
00:48:58.560 --> 00:49:00.300
the focus isn't on making the best music

1173
00:49:00.300 --> 00:49:03.120
so you can become rich and famous.

1174
00:49:03.120 --> 00:49:05.730
The focus is just on how do I become rich and famous?

1175
00:49:05.730 --> 00:49:08.700
And that's a, we do sound like too old men yelling

1176
00:49:08.700 --> 00:49:10.170
at the files right now saying that,

1177
00:49:10.170 --> 00:49:12.450
but I think that social media has shown us that

1178
00:49:12.450 --> 00:49:15.570
in a more vivid way than any other sort

1179
00:49:15.570 --> 00:49:18.750
of artistic endeavor, creative endeavor.

1180
00:49:18.750 --> 00:49:23.100
The path to success, as it's defined there,

1181
00:49:23.100 --> 00:49:25.611
money and fame has never been more vivid.

1182
00:49:25.611 --> 00:49:30.611
You've taken efforts to create boundaries

1183
00:49:30.990 --> 00:49:33.060
between yourself and the internet.

1184
00:49:33.060 --> 00:49:34.470
Like, didn't you get like a flip phone

1185
00:49:34.470 --> 00:49:35.303
or something like that?

1186
00:49:35.303 --> 00:49:36.870
Like I've noticed you've dropped off

1187
00:49:36.870 --> 00:49:39.793
in terms of posting on Twitter and stuff like that.

1188
00:49:39.793 --> 00:49:42.600
I have a new rule with Twitter which is,

1189
00:49:42.600 --> 00:49:46.890
every time I think of something clever, interesting, funny,

1190
00:49:46.890 --> 00:49:50.550
insightful to tweet, instead of tweeting it, I just don't.

1191
00:49:50.550 --> 00:49:51.870
Right. (laughs)
That's my rule.

1192
00:49:51.870 --> 00:49:54.810
Anytime I go to tweet, I have a new rule, just don't.

1193
00:49:54.810 --> 00:49:56.670
And happier as a result.

1194
00:49:56.670 --> 00:50:01.670
Yeah, I mean, look, I have this very idealistic vision,

1195
00:50:01.920 --> 00:50:03.090
which is like, is there a world

1196
00:50:03.090 --> 00:50:05.940
where I can just make great work,

1197
00:50:05.940 --> 00:50:10.890
but divorce myself from the, fame is not the right word,

1198
00:50:10.890 --> 00:50:14.679
but the fame part, you know, like Quentin Tarantino maybe,

1199
00:50:14.679 --> 00:50:17.820
one of the best living filmmakers right now.

1200
00:50:17.820 --> 00:50:19.650
What does he take, like eight years to make a movie?

1201
00:50:19.650 --> 00:50:22.500
So for like seven years, you don't hear his name.

1202
00:50:22.500 --> 00:50:25.140
He's not posting on Twitter, he's not like sharing his,

1203
00:50:25.140 --> 00:50:26.670
he's not making IG stories

1204
